<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #0a0a0a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Hi {{ quote.clientName }},</h1>
    <p>Thanks for your quote request. Here is the recap:</p>

    <div style="background: #fafafa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0;">
        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Plan:</strong> {{ quote.package.name }} ({{ quote.package.maxPages }} pages)</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0 0;"><strong>Build:</strong> {{ (quote.totalOneShotCents / 100)|number_format(0, '.', ',') }} CAD</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0 0;"><strong>Subscription:</strong> {{ (quote.totalMonthlyCents / 100)|number_format(0, '.', ',') }} CAD/month</p>
    </div>

    <p>
        I will personally get back to you within <strong>24 business hours</strong> with the
        next steps (timeline, content requests, signing the official quote).
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 32px;">
        Talk soon,<br />
        <strong>Matthieu Rivière</strong><br />
        <a href="mailto:contact@rivierematthieu.com" style="color: #2B5BD7;">contact@rivierematthieu.com</a> · <a href="tel:+14383678089" style="color: #2B5BD7;">+1 438 367 8089</a><br />
        <span style="color: #707070; font-size: 13px;">3915 Croissant Olivier, Brossard, Québec J4Y 2L2 — NEQ 2279489522</span>
    </p>
</body>
</html>
